# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间来回产生无意义的 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
